{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03758","headline":"送和西蕃使 · 杜审言","name":"送和西蕃使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使出凤皇池，京师阳春晚。\n圣朝尚边策，诏谕兵戈偃。\n拜手明光殿，摇心上林苑。\n种落踰青羌，关山度赤坂。\n疆场及无事，雅歌而餐饭。\n宁独锡和戎，更当封定远。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}